WEBVTT

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:43.660
All that's left are the cat
ears Sister Katsu wanted.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:46.610
But where would you buy cat ears?

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:48.010
Asuka-san!

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.600
Yumi-chan!

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:56.410
That's all Christmas stuff, huh?

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.840
That's an awful lot of bags
you're carrying too, Yumi-chan.

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.700
We're here for the same
reason, aren't we?

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:05.540
We sure are!

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:07.870
Oh, Yumi-chan.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:10.740
I'm looking for cat ears for a present.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.970
Do you know where you can buy some?

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:14.210
Cat ears?

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:18.590
I wonder why Sister Katsu's
even asking for the things!

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:22.220
I can't imagine she'd wear them.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:27.050
She'll probably make me or Ikaruga-san
wear them for sexual harassment purposes!

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:35.140
I was actually heading there myself.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.850
To a place where they sell cat ears.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:37.790
Really?

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:38.630
Yes.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:41.610
But it closes early.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.640
Let's hurry!

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:02.260
It's snowing!

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:04.890
So pretty.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:11.270
I hope it snows on Christmas Eve, too.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.330
Yeah, definitely.

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:18.810
<i>Even the whitest snow</i>

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:23.990
<i>will mix with the dirt and disappear
when it touches the ground.</i>

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:33.300
<i>The world isn't full of just pretty things.</i>

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.120
<i>Where there is light,</i>

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.210
<i>there is also shadow.</i>

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:43.420
<i>This is the story of the shinobi
girls who live in the shadows.</i>

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.150
<b><i>Senran</i></b>

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.160
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:08.200
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:08.200
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:25.800
Meow.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.670
Cuteness is justice!

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:34.620
Asuka-san,

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.240
what do you think about this?

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.700
I think it's very cute.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:40.230
Asuka-san!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.100
Those aren't cat ears,
they're bunny ears.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.240
I know that!

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:48.220
But I think I want a pair of my own.

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:49.340
Hey, Yumi-chan,

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:52.030
do you think I should wear
these from now on when I fight?

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:56.500
You know what you always say, right?

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.340
"Cuteness is justice!"

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:03.760
Th-Then I'll fight with these on, too!

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.550
Oh, please.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.680
That's silly, isn't it?

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.620
They are cute,

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:14.300
but if I fought with these on,
Homura-chan would get mad at me!

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:18.780
"Asuka, do you think shinobi
missions are some kind of joke?"

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:21.780
"Can you really call yourself my
 rival if you're behaving like that?"

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:29.540
I was so surprised at first.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:35.540
You're a good ninja like me,

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:40.040
but you're friends with Homura
and the other evil ninjas.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:50.060
We've fought a lot because
we're on opposite sides,

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:54.310
but Homura-chan and I have come
to a weird understanding, I guess.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:04.820
You know, she's a really
simple girl at heart.

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:11.070
Curses! That Asuka is talking about
me behind my back, isn't she?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:14.810
We don't have time to work
at this part-time job!

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:19.840
If we don't train more, Asuka might catch
us off-guard during our next battle.

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:22.910
You guys want to train too, right?

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:26.350
We'd love to quit this job, but...

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:31.300
You were the one who said she wanted
to have a turkey for Christmas, right?

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.450
We're renegade shinobi.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.350
We can't afford meat without
working part-time jobs.

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:42.600
If you'd like a sprout cake
for Christmas, I'll get it ready.

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:46.160
Training... or turkey?

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.440
The ultimate choice.

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:50.500
No!

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:53.120
There's a way we can get both!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.370
We do this!

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:56.800
See?

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:00.360
We can train our legs while
also getting our turkey!

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.880
Two birds with one stone!

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:04.460
No, two turkeys with one stone!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.600
Do we have to do that, too?

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.060
Of course you do.

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:11.010
We're Homura's Crimson Squad.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.890
We're family!

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.800
I've never heard of a family like that.

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:18.610
She's not going to drop it.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:19.530
Let's do it.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:20.890
Yeah...

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.650
It's almost time for another
wonderful Christmas!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.400
Buy your presents here!

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:33.100
Yumi-chan!

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:35.660
How's it going?

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:37.690
Just give me another second.

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:39.160
I'm almost done.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.170
Wh-What do you think?

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.560
You're super cute!

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:50.220
You'll be the belle
of the Christmas party!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.930
Do you really think so?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.400
While we're here,

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.430
why not try some other outfits on?

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.870
I'll join you!

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:49.490
I think this is going a little too far.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.990
Y-Yeah, you're right.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.000
That was so much fun, wasn't it?

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:09.850
I was really embarrassed.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.980
Wow, you're so cute!

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.380
Wow!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.650
Get one of me, too!

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:16.230
Please!

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:16.760
Sure.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:17.480
How's that?

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:19.260
Here's your order.

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:30.330
Maybe I'll take a photo, too.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.770
What about you, Yumi-chan?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.770
I don't have a smartphone.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:36.780
You don't?

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:40.720
Everyone tells me to get one,

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:43.290
but I've never ran into trouble without one.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.270
Yumi-chan!

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:45.040
Yes?

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:50.550
But what do you do when
you need to talk to other people?

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.120
I send letters.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.800
And when you're in a hurry?

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.800
Telegrams, sometimes.

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:59.850
I suppose I should've
expected that knowing you, but...

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:04.310
Do you think I'd be better
off with a smartphone?

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:06.810
I'm not sure.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.580
But if you did have one,

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:12.320
I'd text you all the time!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.570
<b>Asuka-san</b>

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.570
<b>Hey
Get this~</b>

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:26.730
That sounds wonderful.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:33.210
<b>Update</b>

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:33.210
<b>Giant Hole on
Kikaijima Island</b>

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:36.090
<b>Giant Hole on
Kikaijima Island</b>

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:36.090
I've been thinking a lot lately.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:39.230
About our real task as shinobi.

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:42.110
To pursue justice at all costs.

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:47.100
Even if we lose our lives
in the battle with the youma.

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:51.900
I think all the girls who became
shinobi are willing to do that.

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:54.110
I know I am.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:10:00.410
But that's why those little gaps
between training and missions...

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.170
Times like this, you know...

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:04.780
I really want to enjoy them.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.730
Work when it's time to work.

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.770
Play when it's time to play.

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:10.440
That's what you mean, right?

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:14.130
Yeah.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.380
Ordinarily, we'd be high school girls,

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:23.640
and this would be the most
fun time of our lives.

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:51.670
Work and play...

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:55.620
They seem like opposites,
but they're similar somehow.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:58.610
Does this feeling remind you of anything?

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.070
"A sword and a shield."

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.550
Oh, Grandpa's words.

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:06.600
Yes.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.830
A sword alone can only hurt people.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:14.190
But a shield can't protect them alone.

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:19.190
That's why power needs to
 be both sword and shield.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:22.270
Too much work is exhausting.

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:25.200
And too much play won't make you stronger.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.700
You're right. Maybe they are similar!

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:31.700
Asuka-san!

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:33.420
You're missing your cat ears!

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:37.000
You're right! They're not here!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:40.720
Did you drop them while
we were shopping?

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:42.680
What do we do?

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.970
That was the last pair they had!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.680
Let's look for them.

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:57.730
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:57.730
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.930
Nobody will see us here, right?

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.760
Yes.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.810
Let's take a shortcut, then.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:17.150
Asuka-san,

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:18.920
let's split up and search.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:19.800
Yeah!

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:31.680
What was that?

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:32.770
What's wrong?

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:40.660
Do your shopping here!

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:42.410
Have a fun Christmas—

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:51.540
Homura-chan!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.650
Asuka!

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:57.050
You don't think you can
just ignore me, do you?

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:01.790
I'm sorry, Homura-chan!

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:03.260
I'm in a hurry!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.050
We can fight some other time!

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.520
What's gotten into her?

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.340
We all left at different times,

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:18.560
but we all ended up together, huh?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:22.820
Asuka-san might be closer
than we think, too.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.210
Yagyu-chan,

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.850
what will you give me for a present?

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:28.440
You want me to tell you now?

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:30.780
I can't do that.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:34.080
But I can't wait!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.290
Tell me!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:39.210
I can't wait for Christmas!

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:41.460
Don't look at me that way.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.280
It's not fair.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.960
You're making me want to tell you...

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:48.970
No, you're making me want
to give you a present right now!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:52.010
What are you giving me, Ikaruga?

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:53.740
Don't worry.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.740
I have an amazing present ready for you.

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:59.420
Wow, I can't wait!

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:02.160
I'm sure you'll love it.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.980
Something I'll love?

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.110
It must be...

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:10.000
A ticket to play with your
breasts as much as I want!

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:13.740
You know I wouldn't give
you something so lewd!

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:17.330
Then it doesn't have to be a present!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.410
Let me play with them right now!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:20.490
No!

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:21.750
Stop it!

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.120
Your lips say no,

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.740
but your tits say yes.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.640
Stop it.

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.370
Did you feel that, Ikaruga.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.520
Yes, I did.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:34.680
An incredible murderous aura.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.370
Hibaru, be careful.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:37.200
Okay!

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:57.710
Yeah, that's right!

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.790
Whew, I found it.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:03.000
I see.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:06.520
So this is a time when
you'd want a smartphone.

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.970
Are you shinobi?

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.470
A shinobi kekkai barrier?

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:21.780
So they <i>are</i> shinobi?

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:23.230
Are they evil ninjas, then?

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.870
No, wait.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:26.240
Those uniforms...

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:30.120
Gessen Girls' Academy Middle School?

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:33.800
They go to Yumi-chan's school?

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:36.230
They're good ninjas, like us?

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:38.000
Then what are they doing?

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.020
You? Good ninjas?

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:41.320
Don't make me laugh.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.420
What?

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.000
Answer me this, then.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.500
What is power to you?

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.940
What is justice?

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:51.520
I don't know how to answer that.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:54.210
She's not here now,

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:57.570
but if I may use the words
of one of my friends...

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.890
Power is a sword and a shield.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.890
We take the strong power of a sword

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.900
and turn it into a shield
to protect someone.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:05.900
That is power used properly.

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.900
That is justice, I believe.

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:11.900
It's hilarious to see someone use
 so many platitudes in one sentence.

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:16.170
Your justice is not needed
in the world of shinobi.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:18.170
It dulls resolve that should be pure.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:20.840
So what will you do, then?

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:23.070
Eliminate you here.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:25.410
With the power of true justice!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.670
Shinobi...

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:33.130
...transformation!

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:44.180
It's me.

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.180
Huh? Yumi-chan?

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:47.400
What's wrong?

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.020
Where are you calling from?

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:51.200
A payphone?

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:53.490
Yeah. Yeah...

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.810
Really?

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:56.330
You found the cat ears!

00:16:57.390 --> 00:16:59.790
No, I'm glad...

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.940
No. No.

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:04.200
I'll see you at that café we were just at.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.820
Be right there!

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.910
What is this awful feeling?

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.070
Those are youma!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:40.320
Shinobi... transformation!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.120
I am Asuka, a shinobi
who fights for justice!

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:57.220
I'm sorry.

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.650
A sword...

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:06.830
and a shield?

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:17.210
Pathetic.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:19.910
Struggling to fight such weak youma...

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:26.160
Who are you?

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:29.660
I am Gekkou.

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.170
I am Senkou.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:39.500
So you're the fool who compares
power to a sword and a shield?

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:46.190
We can't let your naïveté infect
the rest of the good ninjas.

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:49.690
So we will remove you from
the world of shinobi.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:52.940
Wait, I don't understand!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:55.950
<i>They're so fast!</i>

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:58.590
We will carve it deep into your body.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.710
Pure resolve...

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.720
<i>They're strong!</i>

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:33.230
If you're expecting your
friends to save you,

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:35.040
I'm afraid that's impossible.

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:50.750
Why?

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:54.810
We've already carved pure resolve into

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:58.260
the rest of Hanzo Academy's students.

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:00.750
What did you do?

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:06.010
What did you do to them?

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:07.520
Foolish.

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.640
Too easy.

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:28.530
Wait, Senkou.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:35.190
I won't lose.

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:37.240
You can still stand?

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:41.820
I refuse to lose...

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:45.510
Until I master the path of the shinobi!

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:58.600
<i>Asuka-chan!</i>

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:00.690
<i>Asuka...</i>

00:21:02.020 --> 00:21:03.020
<i>Asuka-san...</i>

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.190
<i>Asuka...</i>

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.790
You dropped this.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:17.210
Thanks.

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.500
You're welcome.

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:25.080
I see.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:28.550
So you're Yumi-san.

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:13.350
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:14.100
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:14.810
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:15.140
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:17.310
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:17.310
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:28.400
Look, everybody!

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:30.930
I'm wearing a super-sexy swimsuit!

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:34.840
This is a special chemical that makes
whatever you're wearing transparent!
